{"id":786590,"title":"29｜AutoGen基础环境安装","content":"本节课指导如何安装AutoGen Studio，整个过程基于Python环境，并推荐使用Anaconda管理以避免冲突。即使不熟悉Python或Conda，也能通过逐步跟随操作轻松完成安装。首先访问指定链接下载与讲师相同版本的Anaconda（如2023.09-0），选择适合的操作系统版本进行安装。安装后，打开Anaconda Prompt，创建并激活一个名为“大白”的Python 3.10环境。接着，利用阿里云镜像加速安装AutoGen Studio：`pip install autogen-studio -i https://mirrors.aliyun.com/pypi/simple/`。安装完成后，运行`autogen studio ui-port 8081`启动服务，在浏览器中访问`localhost:8081`即可开始使用。此外，还需安装免费版PyCharm作为开发调试工具，将其与之前创建的Conda环境绑定，确保开发环境一致。","comments":[{"had_liked":false,"id":406964,"user_name":"Geek_GO","can_delete":false,"product_type":"c3","uid":3175783,"ip_address":"重庆","ucode":"306A3FD9082FD8","user_header":"","comment_is_top":false,"comment_ctime":1776594887,"is_pvip":false,"replies":null,"discussion_count":1,"race_medal":3,"score":2,"product_id":100775901,"comment_content":"安装好了，运行也可以。关闭后就再也打不开了","like_count":0,"discussions":[{"author":{"id":3175783,"avatar":"","nickname":"Geek_GO","note":"","ucode":"306A3FD9082FD8","race_medal":3,"user_type":1,"is_pvip":false},"reply_author":{"id":0,"avatar":"","nickname":"","note":"","ucode":"","race_medal":0,"user_type":1,"is_pvip":false},"discussion":{"id":684396,"discussion_content":"解决了，切换用户，重新启动","content_length":39,"likes_number":0,"is_delete":false,"is_hidden":false,"ctime":1776640665,"is_liked":false,"can_delete":false,"is_complain":false,"is_top":false,"parent_id":0,"ip_address":"重庆","group_id":0,"attachments":[]},"score":2,"extra":"","child_discussion_number":0,"child_discussions":[]}]},{"had_liked":false,"id":393535,"user_name":"下一站","can_delete":false,"product_type":"c3","uid":1457444,"ip_address":"浙江","ucode":"53FD0E54DFFFEE","user_header":"http://thirdwx.qlogo.cn/mmopen/vi_32/Q0j4TwGTfTL3l6I2icSSK64iarRzk3NVGPCDm1rMGarkjKFyyjYsXMZjNMM8eSnEH9Dvc5IoPr5PbVqibGHNYcs7Q/132","comment_is_top":false,"comment_ctime":1724136348,"is_pvip":false,"replies":null,"discussion_count":0,"race_medal":0,"score":2,"product_id":100775901,"comment_content":"操作文档有吗？我怎么没找到啊","like_count":0}]}